The National Security Council (NSC) is hereby
reconstituted and shall be composed of the following:
President as Chairperson;
b. Vice-President;
Senate President;
Speaker of the House of Representatives;
Senate President Pro-Tempore;
Deputy Speakers for Luzon, Visayas and Mindanao;
g. Majority Floor Leader of the Senate;
Majority Floor Leader of the House;
Minority Floor Leader of the Senate;
